  "description": "This balance bike is ideal for young riders aged 3 and up. It features a lightweight, durable steel frame, 12” rubber wheels for a smooth ride, and a tool-free adjustable seat for growing kids. Bright Nishiki decals add a playful finishing touch.\nManufacturer may substitute components with components of equal or greater performance level.\n\nFeatures:\n\nIdeal beginner bike for young riders ages 3+ riding on sidewalks or around the neighborhood\n\nFits riders 2'6\"-3'3\" tall with a 12\"-14\" inseam\n\nDurable steel frame and fork built to withstand daily rides and outdoor adventures\n\nLow step through design is perfect for young athletes\n\nLow-maintenance 12\" rubber tires provide great traction and control for confident riding on sidewalks and paved paths\n\nTool-free adjustable seat post for growing kids\n\nComfortable seat and easy-to-reach handlebars\n\nBike weighs approximately 12 lbs.\n\nAssembly tools included (Allen Key and Wrench)",
